# In-source cmake output from a prior host-side emp build. The image runs a
# fresh in-container cmake, and a copied-in CMakeCache.txt (which bakes the
# absolute host source path) or a pre-existing build/ breaks the emp-builder
# stage. These are all git-ignored generated files.
